# HathaFlow Live (LiveKit), 2026-11-12
msgid "Live online classes (HathaFlow Live)"
msgstr "Élő online órák (HathaFlow Live)"

msgid "Online classes run on the site itself: only the people who booked get in, from their account or the link in their emails, in the browser, nothing to download, no Zoom. The class chat stays after the class. The video goes through LiveKit (livekit.io, LiveKit Cloud): create a project there and copy its URL (wss://…), API key and secret here, or put them in wp-config.php as OYS_LIVEKIT_URL, OYS_LIVEKIT_API_KEY and OYS_LIVEKIT_API_SECRET."
